      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُعْيِيَّةٌ</span></b> , (K, TA,) [originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُعْيُويَةٌ</span>,] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُحْجِيَّةٌ</span>
